# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.env

# The raw crawl database is NOT needed for deployment (query/snippet.py now
# reads pre-extracted text from index.db instead of re-parsing raw HTML at
# request time -- see index/inverted_index.py's snippet_text column). It's
# also ~1GB for a full crawl, far too large to want in git history anyway.
# Keep it locally for re-indexing, but never commit it.
data/crawled_pages.db

# index.db (the actual inverted index) IS committed -- this app is
# read-only at serve time, so the deployed instance needs this file to have
# anything to search. If it's still over ~100MB after rebuilding with the
# snippet_text change, use Git LFS for this one file (see deploy notes).
data/index.db 
 